    - minimalmodbus's Instrument is fundamentally serial-port oriented; there is no supported way in core minimalmodbus to open a Modbus TCP connection via 
host/port, which is what ModbusTcpClient(host, port=port) requires.
    - minimalmodbus has no connect()/close() lifecycle or isError()-style response objects; it performs synchronous register reads/writes directly and signals 
